{
  "name": "每日早晨金句晨報與 Gmail 自動排程發信",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⏰ 每日晨間自動發信流程\n\n1. **Schedule Trigger**：設定每天早晨（例如 08:30）自動定時觸發。\n2. **HTTP Request**：從公開 API 即時獲取今日隨機勵志金句。\n3. **Edit Fields (Set)**：整理引言內容、作者與格式化當前日期。\n4. **Gmail**：自動組裝精美 HTML 郵件卡片並寄送至指定信箱！",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "note-gmail-overview",
      "name": "流程總覽說明",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 8,
              "triggerAtMinute": 30
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -160,
        140
      ],
      "id": "schedule-morning-trigger",
      "name": "每天早晨 08:30 定時觸發"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://zenquotes.io/api/random",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [
        100,
        140
      ],
      "id": "http-fetch-quote",
      "name": "取得每日勵志金句"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "set-quote",
              "name": "quoteText",
              "value": "={{ $json[0].q || $json.q }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-author",
              "name": "quoteAuthor",
              "value": "={{ $json[0].a || $json.a }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-date",
              "name": "currentDate",
              "value": "={{ $now.format('yyyy 年 MM 月 dd 日 EEEE') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-time",
              "name": "currentTime",
              "value": "={{ $now.format('HH:mm:ss') }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        360,
        140
      ],
      "id": "set-format-morning-data",
      "name": "整理晨報與日期資料"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "YOUR_EMAIL@gmail.com",
        "subject": "=☀️ 【早安晨報】{{ $json.currentDate }} 每日能量金句",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 16px; background-color: #f8fafc;\">\n  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n    <span style=\"background: #dbeafe; color: #1d4ed8; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold;\">n8n 自動化晨間快遞</span>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #0f172a; margin: 12px 0 4px 0;\">☀️ 早安！美好的一天從這裡開始</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; margin: 0;\">{{ $json.currentDate }}</p>\n  </div>\n  \n  <div style=\"background: #ffffff; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border-left: 5px solid #3b82f6; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); margin: 20px 0;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #1e293b; font-style: italic; margin-top: 0;\">\n      “{{ $json.quoteText }}”\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"text-align: right; color: #64748b; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n      —— {{ $json.quoteAuthor }}\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"text-align: center; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 24px;\">\n    <p style=\"margin: 0;\">本郵件由 n8n 工作流程於 {{ $json.currentTime }} 自動生成與排程發送</p>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        620,
        140
      ],
      "id": "gmail-send-morning-mail",
      "name": "Gmail 自動寄出 HTML 晨報",
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "YOUR_GMAIL_CRED_ID",
          "name": "Gmail account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
